    skos:definition "A chemical reaction in which a product (or a reaction intermediate) also functions as a catalyst. In such a reaction the observed rate of reaction is often found to increase with time from its initial value."@en ;
    skos:inScheme goldbook: ;
    skos:prefLabel "autocatalytic reaction"@en ;
